ence Education Program</a> (Gunjan Baid, Sam Lau, Ryan Lovett, Yuvi Panda, Vinitra Swamy)</p><p name="8f06" id="8f06" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.calblueprint.org/&amp;sa=D&amp;ust=1498755372168000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFqs3qDHccsrEcZoO1MnXMkdcmGHw" data-href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.calblueprint.org/&amp;sa=D&amp;ust=1498755372168000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFqs3qDHccsrEcZoO1MnXMkdcmGHw" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Cal Blueprint</a> Team (Jiefu Gong, Sam Lau, Derrick Mar, Peter Veerman, Tony Yang)</p><p name="c9dd" id="c9dd" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing"><a href="http://jupyter.org/" data-href="http://jupyter.org/" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Project Jupyter</a> (Chris Holdgraf, Yuvi Panda, Min Ragan-Kelley, Carol Willing)</p></div></div></section>
